      "features": [],
      "notes": [
        "The unique design of the Parasmillie® harvester makes it the highest quality one-",
        "pass harvester available.",
        "Crescent-shaped blades ensure a full-depth cut in a single push, while atraumatic",
        "“feet” protect surrounding tissue during insertion and cutting. The feet follow the",
        "fiber contours of the tendon to harvest strong, whole fibers of a consistent depth and",
        "width.",
        "The Parasmillie harvester is designed to push up rather than pull down, allowing",
        "the choice of a one-incision or smaller two-incision technique. Single-use blade",
        "tips easily slide on and lock. When you’re finished, pop the blade from the reusable",
        "handle with one easy push of a button."
      ],
      "keyParameters": [],
      "columnCount": 1
    },
